      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hi ​<user-mention data-id=\"107852\">@KarthikBNayak</user-mention>,</p><p>I think this “seeed Studio” is not a ST board, so in STM32CubeAI Studio, do not select a target, like the STM32N657DK, but the MCU directly. You should find another page for MCU directly.</p><p> </p><p>Have a good day,</p><p>Julian</p></div>"
